                            <Polygon POINTS="545 780 545 796 2317 796 2317 780 2317 753 2211 753 2196 741 2194 741 2192 741 2190 741 2143 751 1923 741 1921 741 1919 741 1917 741 1902 753 1705 753 1658 741 1656 741 1555 751 1447 741 1446 741 1344 751 1262 741 1260 741 1212 751 1192 741 1190 741 1073 741 1071 741 1017 751 836 741 834 741 832 741 830 741 814 753 633 753 563 741 561 741 559 741 557 741 545 749 545 780"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="this to my Chukchee friends, they would instantly answer, “A wronged man"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-138_l7" HPOS="547" VPOS="798" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="547 841 2317 841" TAGREFS="TYPE_3">
