                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="541 1979 541 2002 637 1991 1307 2000 1309 2000 1311 2000 1332 1991 1502 1998 1504 1998 1681 1989 1757 1998 1759 1998 1867 1989 1886 1998 1888 1998 1890 1998 1962 1989 1983 1998 1985 1998 1987 1998 2048 1989 2071 1998 2073 1998 2075 1998 2153 1989 2289 1998 2291 1998 2293 1998 2295 1998 2311 1987 2311 1975 2307 1948 2083 1936 2081 1936 2022 1946 1991 1936 1989 1936 1987 1936 1915 1946 1888 1936 1886 1936 1884 1936 1839 1946 1800 1936 1798 1936 1796 1936 1689 1946 1658 1936 1656 1936 1654 1936 1652 1936 1621 1946 1590 1936 1588 1936 1586 1936 1584 1936 1549 1946 1375 1938 1373 1938 1371 1938 1370 1938 1354 1950 1161 1950 1108 1938 1106 1938 1104 1938 1081 1948 1050 1938 1048 1938 1046 1938 984 1948 970 1938 968 1938 966 1938 874 1938 873 1938 806 1948 748 1938 746 1938 744 1938 705 1948 609 1938 607 1938 539 1950 541 1979"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="and in the middle of the camp. He promised to give her for this a new"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-138_l27" HPOS="541" VPOS="1996" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="541 2037 2309 2037" TAGREFS="TYPE_3">
                        <Shape>
